<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-023" chapter-id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen" source-id="s-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen-ws1514496">
  <p id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p001:m0000" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AA">沈君理</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p001:m0004" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AA">仲倫</persName>，吳興人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p001:m0013" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1">僧畟</persName>，梁左民尚書。父<persName id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p001:m0023" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_A">巡</persName>，素與高祖相善，梁太清中為東陽太守。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">侯景平後，元帝徵為少府卿。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">高祖鎮南徐州，巡遣<persName id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p003:m0009" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AA">君理</persName>自東陽謁于高祖，高祖器之，命尚<persName id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p003:m0026" ref="3eu_ixs_h1w_C">會稽長公主</persName></p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">二年，高宗以<persName id="c-chenshu-023-shenwuhua-shen:p004:m0006" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AA">君理</persName>女為皇太子妃</p>
</text>
